.hu/?m=hkk&amp;in=hkk.php&amp;kartya=12400\" title=\"tooltip\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 103, 163); font-weight: bold;\">Viaszgólem (2027)</a> (Tharr szörny)<br></td><td><a class=\"lapnw myTooltip\" image=\"php/hkk_lapkep.php?id=12372\" href=\"https://www.beholder.hu/?m=hkk&amp;in=hkk.php&amp;kartya=12372\" title=\"tooltip\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 103, 163); font-weight: bold;\">Yeti nagymogul (2027)</a> (Leah szörny)<br></td></tr><tr><td><a class=\"lapnw myTooltip\" image=\"php/hkk_lapkep.php?id=12364\" href=\"https://www.beholder.hu/?m=hkk&amp;in=hkk.php&amp;kartya=12364\" title=\"tooltip\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 103, 163); font-weight: bold;\">Zu'lit apró mozdulata</a> (Fairlight azonnali)<br></td><td>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>67 kártya felelt meg a beállított feltételeknek.</b></td></tr></tbody></table><br><script>tableheadvekonyrugo(\"CENTER\");</script><center><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"tablefelsobalvekony3\"></td><td class=\"tablefelsovekony3\"></td><td class=\"tablefelsojobbvekony3\"></td></tr><tr><td class=\"tablebalvekony3\"></td><td class=\"tablebody\">\r\n";        

        string pattern =
            @"kartya=(\d+).*?>" +          // ID
            @"(.*?)</a>\s*" +               // Card name
            @"\(([^()]+)\)<br>";            // Type

        var matches = Regex.Matches(
            input,
            pattern,
            RegexOptions.Singleline
        );

        var sb = new StringBuilder();

        foreach (Match match in matches)
        {
            string id = match.Groups[1].Value;
            string name = match.Groups[2].Value.Trim();
            string type = match.Groups[3].Value.Trim();

            sb.AppendLine($"{id} | {name} | {type}");
        }

        File.WriteAllText("Lovagi torna - ritka.txt", sb.ToString(), Encoding.UTF8);
    }
}
